OL,3,ABBC films thieves in the act while
OL,4,Amaking shoplifting report in Greggs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 500,000 shoplifting offences
OL,7,Fwere recorded by police forces in
OL,8,FEngland last year ` and just over half
OL,9,Fwere closed without an identified
OL,10,Fsuspect
OL,12,FWhile out reporting on the issue, a BBC
OL,13,Fteam witnessed a pair of shoplifters in
OL,14,Faction
OL,16,FOne shop owner said she keeps the doors
OL,17,Flocked during opening hours, while
OL,18,Fanother describes being dragged over
OL,19,Fthe counter
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
