OL,3,AAll support acts on Ed Sheeran's US
OL,4,Atour quit after Macklemore dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcements came hours after
OL,7,FSheeran said he would not be drawn into
OL,8,Fa public debate over Gaza, and stressed
OL,9,Fhe was not responsible for Macklemore
OL,10,Fbeing removed from the tour.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
